    // RefreshTaskCardsAsync 已合并到 RefreshAllAsync → BuildTaskCardsAsync（单趟遍历 + 共享阶段事件）

    /// <summary>段1 任务号 → 段2 任务号（a → b）。非 SimAuto_ 或不以 a 结尾直接返回原值。</summary>
    private static string Seg2Id(string seg1Id)
    {
        if (seg1Id.StartsWith("SimAuto_", StringComparison.OrdinalIgnoreCase) && seg1Id.Length >= 2 && seg1Id[^1] == 'a')
            return seg1Id[..^1] + "b";
        return seg1Id;
    }
    private async Task RefreshArrivalsNow(bool showFeedback = true) { _arrivalBusy = true; await RefreshAllAsync(); _arrivalBusy = false; if (showFeedback) ShowFeedback(v => _arrivalRefreshMsg = v, "✓ 刷新成功", ref _arrivalRefreshTimer); }
    private async Task ToggleArrivalMode() => await SignalAuto.ToggleArrivalAsync();
    private async Task RefreshRemovalsNow(bool showFeedback = true) { _removalBusy = true; await RefreshAllAsync(); _removalBusy = false; if (showFeedback) ShowFeedback(v => _removalRefreshMsg = v, "✓ 刷新成功", ref _removalRefreshTimer); }
    private async Task ToggleRemovalMode() => await SignalAuto.ToggleRemovalAsync();
    private async Task ConfirmArrival(ArrivalCard c)
    {
        _arrivalBusy = true;
        var claimed = await ClaimAsync("arrival", c.TaskId, null);
        if (claimed is null) { _cardError = "无法连接后端，确认失败"; _arrivalBusy = false; return; }
        if (!claimed.Value)
        {
            await RefreshAllAsync();
            _cardError = "该到达信号已在其他标签页确认";
            _arrivalBusy = false;
            return;
        }
        var (ok, _, _) = await WcsService.SendContainerReadyAsync("", "1.0", new WcsContainerReadyRequest { TaskId = c.TaskId, StationCode = c.ConveyorCode, ContainerCode = c.ContainerCode, Warehouse = c.Warehouse });
        if (!ok)
        {
            await UnclaimAsync("arrival", c.TaskId);
            _cardError = "container_ready 发送失败，已回滚确认";
            await RefreshAllAsync();
            _arrivalBusy = false;
            return;
        }
        // 乐观更新：立即翻转卡片（不依赖 AutoHub 下一轮轮询）；claim 已落库，1s 后轮询回读保持一致
        _confirmedTasks.Add(c.TaskId);
        foreach (var card2 in _arrivalCards) if (card2.TaskId == c.TaskId) card2.Confirmed = true;
        _pendingArrival = _arrivalCards.Count(x => !x.Confirmed);
        _cardError = "";
        _arrivalBusy = false;
        StateHasChanged();
    }
    private async Task ConfirmRemoval(RemovalCard c)
    {
        _removalBusy = true;
        var claimed = await ClaimAsync("removal", c.TaskId, null);
        if (claimed is null) { _cardError = "无法连接后端，确认失败"; _removalBusy = false; return; }
        if (!claimed.Value)
        {
            await RefreshAllAsync();
            _cardError = "该移除信号已在其他标签页确认";
            _removalBusy = false;
            return;
        }
        var (ok, _, _) = await WcsService.SendContainerRemoveAsync("", "1.0", new WcsContainerRemoveRequest { StationCode = c.ConveyorCode, ContainerCode = c.ContainerCode, Warehouse = c.Warehouse });
        if (!ok)
        {
            await UnclaimAsync("removal", c.TaskId);
            _cardError = "container_remove 发送失败，已回滚确认";
            await RefreshAllAsync();
            _removalBusy = false;
            return;
        }
        // 乐观更新：立即翻转卡片（不依赖 AutoHub 下一轮轮询）；claim 已落库，1s 后轮询回读保持一致
        _confirmedRemovalTasks.Add(c.TaskId);
        foreach (var card2 in _removalCards) if (card2.TaskId == c.TaskId) card2.Confirmed = true;
        _pendingRemoval = _removalCards.Count(x => !x.Confirmed);
        _cardError = "";
        _removalBusy = false;
        StateHasChanged();
    }
    private async void DeleteArrival(ArrivalCard c) { _arrivalCards.Remove(c); _deletedArrivalTasks.Add(c.TaskId); await SaveArrivalState(); }
    private async void ClearAllArrivals() { foreach (var c in _arrivalCards) _deletedArrivalTasks.Add(c.TaskId); _arrivalCards.Clear(); await SaveArrivalState(); _arrivalConfirming = false; ShowFeedback(v => _arrivalClearMsg = v, "清空完成", ref _arrivalClearTimer); }
    private async void DeleteRemoval(RemovalCard c) { _removalCards.Remove(c); _deletedRemovalTasks.Add(c.TaskId); await SaveRemovalState(); }
    private async void ClearAllRemovals() { foreach (var c in _removalCards) _deletedRemovalTasks.Add(c.TaskId); _removalCards.Clear(); await SaveRemovalState(); _removalConfirming = false; ShowFeedback(v => _removalClearMsg = v, "清空完成", ref _removalClearTimer); }
    private async Task SaveArrivalState() { _deletedArrivalTasks = PruneDeleted(_deletedArrivalTasks); await LocalStore.SetAsync(Js, "grcs_si_del_arrival", System.Text.Json.JsonSerializer.Serialize(_deletedArrivalTasks)); }
    private async Task SaveRemovalState() { _deletedRemovalTasks = PruneDeleted(_deletedRemovalTasks); await LocalStore.SetAsync(Js, "grcs_si_del_removal", System.Text.Json.JsonSerializer.Serialize(_deletedRemovalTasks)); }
    private async Task RestoreArrival(string taskId) { _deletedArrivalTasks.Remove(taskId); await SaveArrivalState(); await RefreshAllAsync(); }
    private async Task RestoreRemoval(string taskId) { _deletedRemovalTasks.Remove(taskId); await SaveRemovalState(); await RefreshAllAsync(); }
    private async Task RestoreAllArrivals() { _deletedArrivalTasks.Clear(); await SaveArrivalState(); await RefreshAllAsync(); }
    private async Task RestoreAllRemovals() { _deletedRemovalTasks.Clear(); await SaveRemovalState(); await RefreshAllAsync(); }

    /// <summary>删除集合只保留最近 300 条，防止无限增长并避免旧任务号被永久抑制（任务号按时间戳生成，越旧越不可能复用）。</summary>
    private static HashSet<string> PruneDeleted(HashSet<string> set)
    {
        if (set.Count <= 300) return set;
        return set.OrderBy(id => id).TakeLast(300).ToHashSet();
    }

    // ── 分拣信号 ──
    private async Task ToggleAutoSend() => await SignalAuto.ToggleSortingAsync(); // 自动开关与自动发送在 SignalAutoService
    private async Task RefreshSortingNow(bool showFeedback = true) { _busy = true; await RefreshAllAsync(); _busy = false; if (showFeedback) ShowFeedback(v => _sortingRefreshMsg = v, "✓ 刷新成功", ref _sortingRefreshTimer); }

    // ── 分拣编辑弹窗：编辑草稿 → 确认后覆盖表格对应行 ──
    private SortingCard? _editingCard;
    private SortingCard? _editDraft;

    private void OpenEdit(SortingCard card)
    {
        _editingCard = card;
        _editDraft = new SortingCard
        {
            TaskId = card.TaskId,
            ReturnTaskId = card.ReturnTaskId,
            RemoveContainer = card.RemoveContainer,
            DestStation = card.DestStation,
            DestArea = card.DestArea,
        };
        StateHasChanged();
    }

    private void CancelEdit()
    {
        _editingCard = null;
        _editDraft = null;
        StateHasChanged();
    }

    private void SaveEdit()
    {
        if (_editingCard is null || _editDraft is null) return;
        var d = _editDraft;
        _editingCard.ReturnTaskId = d.ReturnTaskId ?? "";
        _editingCard.RemoveContainer = d.RemoveContainer;
        _editingCard.DestStation = d.DestStation ?? "";
        _editingCard.DestArea = d.DestArea ?? "";
        _editingCard = null;
        _editDraft = null;
        StateHasChanged();
    }

    // ScanStages 已合并到 RefreshAllAsync → BuildSortingCards（复用阶段事件，不再额外调 HTTP）

    private async Task SendCard(SortingCard card)
    {
        if (card.Status == "Sending") return;
        card.Status = "Sending";
        // 先抢占：已发送则阻止（防多标签页重复发送）；value 存编辑参数供刷新后重建
        var paramsJson = System.Text.Json.JsonSerializer.Serialize(new SortingSendParams
        {
            ReturnTaskId = string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(card.ReturnTaskId) ? card.TaskId + "_R" : card.ReturnTaskId,
            RemoveContainer = card.RemoveContainer,
            DestStation = card.DestStation ?? "",
            DestArea = card.DestArea ?? "",
        });
        var claimed = await ClaimAsync("sent", card.TaskId, paramsJson);
        if (claimed is null) { card.Status = "Failed"; _sortingResp = "无法连接后端，发送失败"; _sortingRespClass = "error"; StateHasChanged(); return; }
        if (!claimed.Value)
        {
            card.Status = "Failed";
            _sortingResp = "该分拣任务已在其他标签页发送";
            _sortingRespClass = "error";
            await RefreshAllAsync();
            return;
        }
        var sendTaskId = string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(card.ReturnTaskId) ? card.TaskId : card.ReturnTaskId;
        var (ok, code, json) = await WcsService.SendOperationFinishAsync("", "1.0", new WcsOperationFinishRequest { TaskId = sendTaskId, ContainerCode = card.ContainerCode, RemoveContainer = card.RemoveContainer, StationCode = card.DestStation ?? "", AreaCode = card.DestArea ?? "", Warehouse = card.Warehouse });
        if (!ok) await UnclaimAsync("sent", card.TaskId);   // 发送失败回滚抢占，允许重试
        if (ok)
        {
            // 回库任务写台账（TaskType=SORTING_RETURN，TaskId 即回库任务号，供任务看板关联显示）
            var seg1 = (await Ledger.GetAsync()).FirstOrDefault(x => x.TaskId == card.TaskId);
            var dests = new List<string>();
            if (!string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(card.DestStation)) dests.Add(card.DestStation);
            if (!string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(card.DestArea)) dests.Add(card.DestArea);
            await Ledger.AppendAsync([new TaskLedgerEntry
            {
                TaskId = sendTaskId,
                TaskType = "SORTING_RETURN",
                ContainerCode = seg1?.ContainerCode ?? card.ContainerCode,
                CargoCode = seg1?.CargoCode ?? "",
                StationCode = dests,
                Warehouse = card.Warehouse,
                Time = DateTime.Now.ToString("O"),
                Ok = true,
                StatusCode = code
            }]);
        }
        card.SendTime = DateTime.Now; card.Status = ok ? "Sent" : "Failed";
        _sortingResp = $"{(ok ? "✅" : "❌")} HTTP {code}\n\n{json}";
        _sortingRespClass = ok ? "success" : "error";
        await RefreshAllAsync();
    }

    private async Task DeleteCard(SortingCard card) { _cards.Remove(card); _knownTasks.Remove(card.TaskId); await WcsService.DeleteTaskStageAsync("", card.TaskId); StageHub.RemoveTask(card.TaskId); StateHasChanged(); }
    private async Task DeleteAllCards() { foreach (var c in _cards) await WcsService.DeleteTaskStageAsync("", c.TaskId); _cards.Clear(); _knownTasks.Clear(); StageHub.ClearAll(); _sortingConfirming = false; ShowFeedback(v => _sortingClearMsg = v, "清空完成", ref _sortingClearTimer); StateHasChanged(); }

    // ── 信号确认抢占（后端 workflow_state，跨标签页防重复发送）──
    private async Task<bool?> ClaimAsync(string kind, string taskId, string? value)
    {
        try
        {
            var resp = await WcsApi.PostAsync<object, ClaimResponse>(
                $"/api/wcs/signal-confirm/{kind}/{Uri.EscapeDataString(taskId)}", new { value });
            return resp?.Claimed;
        }
        catch { return null; }
    }
    private async Task UnclaimAsync(string kind, string taskId)
        => await WcsApi.DeleteAsync($"/api/wcs/signal-confirm/{kind}/{Uri.EscapeDataString(taskId)}");

    /// <summary>一次性迁移：旧 localStorage 确认集合播种到后端 workflow_state 后清除旧键（Set 幂等，仅补缺）。</summary>
    private async Task MigrateLegacyAsync()
    {
        try
        {
            foreach (var (key, kind) in new[] { ("grcs_arrival_confirmed", "arrival"), ("grcs_removal_confirmed", "removal"), ("grcs_ss_sent", "sent") })
            {
                var s = LocalStore[key];
                if (string.IsNullOrEmpty(s) || s == "null") continue;
                var ids = System.Text.Json.JsonSerializer.Deserialize<List<string>>(s, _jsonOpts) ?? [];
                foreach (var id in ids)
                    await ClaimAsync(kind, id, null);
                await Js.InvokeVoidAsync("grcsStoreRemove", key);
            }
            await Js.InvokeVoidAsync("grcsStoreRemove", "grcs_ss_cards");
        }
        catch { }
    }

    // ── 辅助 ──
    private static string StatusLabel(string s) => s switch { "Pending" => "待确认", "Approved" => "允许待确认", "Allowed" => "已放行", "Rejected" => "已拒绝", _ => s };
    private static string StatusBadgeClass(string s) => s switch { "Pending" => "badge-warn", "Approved" => "badge-info", "Allowed" => "badge-ok", "Rejected" => "badge-error", _ => "" };
    private static string CardStatusLabel(string s) => s switch { "Pending" => "待发送", "Sending" => "发送中...", "Sent" => "已发送", "Failed" => "发送失败", _ => s };
    private static string CardBadgeClass(string s) => s switch { "Pending" => "badge-warn", "Sending" => "badge-selected", "Sent" => "badge-ok", "Failed" => "badge-error", _ => "badge-empty" };
}
